# The ScamShield website the app talks to, with no trailing slash, e.g. https://your-site.vercel.app
# Required for preview and production builds. In development, leave it empty to use the server running on the
# computer that runs `npx expo start` (http://<that computer's address>:3000).
# Never put secrets here: EXPO_PUBLIC_ values are built into the app and anyone can read them.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
